WEBVTT

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:42.750
Mommy!

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:54.860
Here.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:24.450
Isn't it peaceful
today, Tendo?

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:28.690
It really is peaceful, Saotome.
All seems right with the world.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:34.410
The weather is fine,
and I haven't a care in the world.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.700
Exactly.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.050
What's wrong, Akane?

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.690
It's this.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:56.590
Jeez, it's
just a notebook!

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.130
That's...

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:07.200
I was going to air out some old
clothes. It was in the closet.

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:10.740
Isn't this
Mother's notebook?

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.050
It is indeed!

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:18.120
That's right.
I recognize her handwriting!

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:20.310
I knew it!
I knew it!

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:25.910
What's this? "March 2: Cabbage
Rolls. March 3: Chicken Rice..."

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:28.220
"March 4: Prawns
in Chili Sauce..."

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:29.790
A diary?

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:32.990
Sounds like she really
liked to pig out.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.660
Look again.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:39.230
It's not only
her daily menus...

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:43.900
She recorded all details,
from picking ingredients to preparation.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:50.080
These are Mother's
instructional cooking notes.

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:51.910
Her secret recipes.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.450
Secret recipes?

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.430
Do you want to help?

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.800
In the beginning, I just
followed Mother's example.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.180
It was more like playing
with clay than cooking.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:26.180
Some time later, I tried to cook
by the recipes in Mother's book.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:32.420
I was so clumsy at first,
I couldn't even boil water.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:51.170
It's delicious! It's just like
Mother used to make, Kasumi!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.640
Eventually, I learned how to cook.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.840
After that, the notebook vanished.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.690
I couldn't find it,
no matter how hard I looked.

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:11.630
Now, after all this time...
here it is again. I wonder why.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.840
Mother's cooking?

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:32.910
I wish I had a
memory like that!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:36.680
Your mother's
cooking was wonderful!

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:41.220
Especially her stewed daikon.
Tender right to the core!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.860
Exquisitely seasoned...

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:48.860
I'm saying I want to taste my
mother's cooking right now!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.800
Don't talk nonsense!

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:56.140
Did you forget what'll
happen if she catches us?

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:00.210
If she finds out you're not
really a "man among men"...

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.940
We'll both have to
commit seppuku!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.450
I'll bet you're not so
anxious to feel that pain...

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:10.480
Jeez! You and your stupid
promises! You rotten old man...

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:13.250
Hey, Ranma's
mother is here!

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:17.720
Auntie Saotome?
Where?

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.400
You're gonna need
a lot more practice.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:22.690
Hmm? Where is she?

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:32.610
Even I had to start
with boiling water.

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:36.780
Kasumi? Could I
borrow the notebook?

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:40.420
I don't see why not.
I don't need it anymore.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.680
I'll give it
to you, Akane.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.350
Really, Kasumi?

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.050
Take good care of it now!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:57.670
Wow! It really does start
with boiling water!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.670
I wonder if I'm up to this.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.810
Akane!
It's lunch time!

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:13.610
Okay!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.750
Mommy!

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.960
Your lunches are
so good, Mommy!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:28.970
Really?
I'm glad you like it.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.870
I want to cook real good
just like you, Mommy!

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:36.430
Of course.
Someday you will!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.910
You're Mother's little
girl, after all.

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:07.500
I won't let you down, Mommy!

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:10.700
Kasumi!
Are you all right? Kasumi!

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.400
Kasumi?

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:14.810
Kasumi!

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.110
Kasumi!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.050
Kasumi!?

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:23.110
She's okay.
It's just a cold.

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:25.950
She'll be fine, with two
or three days of bed rest.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:31.090
Truly, it's nothing.
Father's just overreacting.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.360
I've got
breakfast to make...

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:37.330
We'll be fine. You just rest.
Do you hear me?

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.730
But...

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:44.070
Leave it to me, Kasumi!
I'll take care of everything!

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.810
Let's go, Ranma!

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:50.840
Where do you
think you're going?

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:56.750
Isn't it obvious? A safe place
where your cooking can't hurt us.

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:58.190
I see...

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:00.020
DIE, RANMA!

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:02.420
I really should...

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:06.090
Kasumi, we appreciate your
sacrifice! But you need rest!

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:10.130
You haven't even tried it!

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:14.100
I don't havta eat your
cooking to know it's toxic.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:16.400
Maybe, maybe not.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:18.570
What's with the
confidence all of a sudden?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.870
Now, I've got...

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:22.570
THIS.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.510
It's the notebook!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.310
The notebook of your
mother, rest her soul!

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.350
You just watch.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:31.510
With Mother's notebook,
I'll make you eat your words!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:42.030
Here it is!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.570
This is one of
your Mom's recipes!?

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:52.470
Sure! Only it seemed a little dull,
so I rearranged it a little!

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:53.530
Well, dig in!

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:57.640
Are you going to
eat it or not!?

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:01.050
H-Here goes nothin'!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.560
Huh?
Don't you like it?

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.560
That's strange.
It should be...

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:22.440
The battle's just begun!
What shall I make next?

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:27.340
What now, Tendo?
If this continues, soon we'll be...

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.610
What can we do?

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.510
Why don't you
let me handle this.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:33.650
Seriously, Nabiki?

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.880
Good girl, Nabiki!
That's Daddy's little girl!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.510
Your father's so proud!

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:44.890
Hello, is this Kin Sushi?

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.990
Yeah, I'd like six orders of
your deluxe sushi combinations...

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.400
No, no, no, no!

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.500
What'd you do
that for, Daddy?

00:10:55.610 --> 00:11:00.600
Nabiki! I have no regular source
of income, three unwed daughters...

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:04.840
And on top of that,
two freeloading house guests!

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:09.590
And you order the
d-de-deluxe combinations!?

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:15.060
If you're going to be
like that, I can't help you.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:17.790
I knew that
would happen!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:22.600
I see I have no choice.
I must reveal my own technique!

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:25.100
You?

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.400
Just like the old days, Saotome!

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:35.100
When we were training, we did
this every day, right, Tendo?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.700
Heat the pot
and the insides pop.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.710
Even if the panda cries,
don't pull off the top!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.840
Cook with the mess kit
and dance for fun.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:44.850
It's all finished,
so here you go, my son.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:47.390
Hey, w-where's the
rest of the meal?

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.760
Here!
It's right here.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:54.820
T-That's just a cabbage!

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:57.730
Aren't you spoiled!

00:11:58.340 --> 00:11:59.200
Here.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:04.360
Mayonnaise and cabbage was
a luxury when we were training!

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:07.880
That's right!
What memories, Saotome!

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:11.640
If that's all I get,
I'll be malnourished!

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:16.750
Excuse me?

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.690
Is anyone home?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:20.420
We have a visitor.

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:22.720
I'll check it out.

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:26.760
Why, hello! Welcome!

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.060
Nabiki! Hello.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:32.970
All I want is a decent meal!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.300
Mrs. Saotome's here.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:39.500
You can't trick
us twice, Nabiki!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:42.140
I hope I'm not imposing...

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:45.000
It's Auntie Saotome!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:46.500
Hello there, someone-else's wife!

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.180
Oh, my! It's Ranko
and Mister Panda!

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.450
Isn't it a little
cold for swimming?

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.320
They need lots
more practice.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:06.260
Kasumi is ill?
How dreadful!

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.900
We count on her for
all the household work.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:15.800
If it's all right with you,
shall I cook your dinner tonight?

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.680
Truly? Mrs. Saotome!

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:24.310
Certainly!
Akane, will you help me?

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.550
I'd love to!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.090
Whatever is the matter?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:35.830
They think my cooking
isn't very good.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.800
"Not very good," she says.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.670
Are you saying it's
unimaginably bad?

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:44.570
You DO understand!

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:49.570
Don't worry, dear.
Auntie will teach you.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.240
You will?
Really?

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.240
You'll be very good!
Shall we work together?

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:59.780
Aunt Saotome!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.660
It's not gonna
do her any good...

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.460
Mrs. Saotome!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:09.430
Can you do it? Can you
really cure Akane!?

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:14.570
Please! Save her!
Save my little Akane!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:18.800
You make it sound like Akane's
got a terminal disease, Daddy.

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:23.080
Auntie Saotome, I wanna
help with the cooking, too!

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:24.350
WHAT!

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:27.210
V-Very well, Ranko.
You may help too.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.310
Thanks!

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.000
Excuse us!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.880
What're you
doin'!? Leggo!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.880
C'mere I said!

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:35.760
Listen, Akane! Work hard with
Mrs. Saotome toward a cure!

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:37.160
Now, wait...!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.750
What are you thinking?!

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:45.200
I gotta! Ma doesn't know how
bad Akane's cooking can be!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.600
I gotta be there!

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:48.500
What are you thinking?!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.000
But the kitchen is dangerous!

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:56.080
Yeah, I know. I gotta
watch out for the hot water.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:03.110
I can do it! I'll show
them that I can be cured!

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:04.620
Shall we begin?

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:08.090
Ranko, will you slice
the vegetables for a salad?

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.090
Okay!

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.060
Can you do that, Ranko?

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:17.070
Just you
watch me, Akane.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.770
Perfect.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:42.660
Very good, Ranko! And you've
arranged them so beautifully!

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:45.790
That's about the
way I wanted it.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:52.930
Oh, no! Can it be I'm an
even worse cook than Ranma!?

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:56.970
It would have been even better
if you'd washed them first!

00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:59.130
Oh, darn!

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:03.300
Now, Akane. Will you
slice me some carrots?

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:06.940
Sure...

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.190
I have to win!

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.630
I can't let a GUY
beat me at cooking!

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.830
What's this?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:30.010
A-A piece of the
cutting board!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:33.770
Good job!

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:34.970
H-Hey...!

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:41.680
Akane, next time let's try to
cut them a little more evenly.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:47.020
If they're sliced uniformly,
they'll all cook at the same rate!

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:50.580
I get it! No wonder I always
had those hard pieces left!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.190
That's 'cause you're
cooking the cutting board!

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.160
Quit your
back-seat driving!

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.160
W-What are you
putting in there!?

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.370
"What?"
Can't you see?

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.240
The hidden taste!
White wine!

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:11.050
Not exactly! It seems
to be vegetable oil!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.210
"Not exactly?"

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.350
It's cold!

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:26.030
H-Hang in there, Akane!
D-Daddy knows you'll be cured!

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:37.500
I'm so sorry.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.200
Don't worry, Akane.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.270
Here you go!

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:45.310
It's your panda food!

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:53.180
What's the matter,
Mister Panda? Aren't you hungry?

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.130
What a good panda you are!

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.480
C'mon, Akane!
Give it up already!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:19.550
I wouldn't talk if
I were you, "Ranko"!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:25.120
No need to get uppity just
because you can use a knife.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.380
What matters in
the end is taste!

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:31.400
Really? You wanna
compare your taste to mine?

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.230
All right.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:38.060
The dish is
vegetable stir-fry.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:39.140
Fine with me.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.500
Ready...
Set...

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:42.000
Go!

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.910
Akane, Mister Panda
ate the whole thing!

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:49.880
Oh my.

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:52.150
Mrs. Saotome? Can you
tell us which is best?

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:53.910
You're the judge!

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:56.880
All right, then.
I'll start with Ranko's dish...

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:01.550
Oh, it's delicious!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.460
Isn't it, though?
Isn't it, isn't it!?

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:06.530
Ranko, you'll make a
wonderful wife someday!

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:08.360
A-A wife!?

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:12.090
Now, let's see
how Akane's tastes.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:37.720
Nice try!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.060
I'm so sorry.

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:43.390
You mustn't be discouraged,
Akane! Be brave!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:46.030
I won, and I'm
not happy at all.

00:19:46.270 --> 00:19:48.530
It can be Mister Panda's food!

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:54.070
Is that right?
Akane and Ranma are fighting...

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:58.480
No kidding. It's a cat fight.
The kitchen's a battlefield!

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:02.810
Then we need to warn them
about the hot-water heater!

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:06.050
What about the
hot-water heater?

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:11.390
Almost finished! Akane,
are the hard-boiled eggs finished?

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:12.990
Uh-oh!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.060
Airhead!

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.870
Stop that!
I can fix 'em in a jiffy!

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:19.830
Jiffy? Hey!

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:23.430
I'll just pop 'em
in the microwave!

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:27.110
S-Stupid! You put raw
eggs in there, and...

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:49.560
Kasumi wanted
you to know...

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:52.400
The hot water pipe's
getting kind of old.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:55.200
So you'd
better watch out...

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.640
Too late.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:04.200
Good grief.

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:10.810
Fainting! How pathetic!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.730
W-What... what have I done?

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.800
Akane, dear.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:34.900
I-I'm sorry! I'm so clumsy!
I ruined your beautiful dinner!

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:38.570
I won't cook anymore...

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:40.310
Why not?

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:43.410
I don't have any talent for it!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:49.120
It's not about talent.
It's about love!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:55.360
You're cooking so you can see
your fiance smile at the taste.

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:58.990
You're working so
hard for Ranma.

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:04.170
Thank you.

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:08.170
Auntie...!

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.440
Let's clean up.

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:11.550
Sure.

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.650
Don't give up, Akane!
A cure is in sight!

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:20.190
And so Akane bravely
continues to cook.

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:25.230
You lucked out, Ranma. Looks
like your mom didn't notice.

00:22:49.450 --> 00:22:52.390
Shall we open our lunches now?

00:22:52.490 --> 00:22:54.680
Okay!

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:14.700
It's good.

00:23:14.810 --> 00:23:16.780
Good.

00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:20.840
Isn't it? Akane boiled
the water all by herself!

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:22.650
Isn't it good, Ranko!?

00:23:23.350 --> 00:23:25.550
Yeah, it's the best.

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:33.000
Mister Panda's Food
